<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Happy Anniversary Ramsii ❤️</title>

<style>

*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
}

html{
  scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
  font-family:Georgia,serif;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff0f5,#ffe4ec,#fff7f9);
  color:#4a2632;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

.section{
  min-height:100vh;
  display:none;
  padding:35px 20px;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  text-align:center;
  position:relative;
}

.section.active{
  display:flex;
  animation:cardIn 1s ease;
}

.card{
  width:min(900px,95%);
  padding:35px 25px;
  border-radius:30px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);
  box-shadow:0 15px 50px rgba(130,50,80,.18);
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
}

h1{
  font-size:clamp(42px,9vw,80px);
  color:#b52f5b;
  margin-bottom:15px;
  animation:beat 2s infinite;
}

h2{
  font-size:clamp(28px,6vw,48px);
  color:#b52f5b;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

h3{
  color:#a82e56;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}

p{
  font-size:18px;
  line-height:1.8;
  margin:12px auto;
  max-width:760px;
}

.date{
  font-size:20px;
  color:#8f3b59;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

button{
  border:none;
  padding:14px 25px;
  margin:10px 5px;
  border-radius:30px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d94372,#b52f5b);
  color:white;
  font-size:16px;
  cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 7px 20px rgba(181,47,91,.25);
  transition:.3s;
}

button:hover{
  transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.03);
}

.musicBox{
  margin:25px auto;
  padding:20px;
  max-width:500px;
  border-radius:25px;
  background:#fff4f7;
  box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(130,50,80,.12);
}

.musicIcon{
  font-size:45px;
  animation:pulseBox 1.5s infinite;
}

.gallery{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:18px;
  max-width:700px;
  margin:25px auto;
}

.gallery img{
  width:100%;
  height:280px;
  object-fit:cover;
  border-radius:22px;
  box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(100,40,70,.2);
  transition:.4s;
}

.gallery img:hover{
  transform:scale(1.03);
}

.memory{
  background:#fff6f8;
  margin:15px auto;
  padding:20px;
  border-radius:22px;
  max-width:700px;
}

.names{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
  gap:15px;
  margin:25px auto;
  max-width:700px;
}

.nameBox{
  padding:20px;
  background:#fff5f7;
  border-radius:20px;
}

.envelope{
  width:280px;
  height:180px;
  margin:30px auto;
  position:relative;
  cursor:pointer;
  perspective:700px;
}

.envelopeBody{
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  background:#e9a0b6;
  border-radius:8px;
  position:absolute;
  box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(120,40,70,.2);
}

.envelopeFlap{
  position:absolute;
  top:0;
  left:0;
  width:0;
  height:0;
  border-left:140px solid transparent;
  border-right:140px solid transparent;
  border-top:100px solid #d87998;
  transform-origin:top;
  transition:.7s;
  z-index:3;
}

.envelope.opened .envelopeFlap{
  transform:rotateX(180deg);
}

.envelopeText{
  position:absolute;
  top:75px;
  width:100%;
  text-align:center;
  color:white;
  font-size:20px;
  z-index:2;
}

.secretLetter{
  display:none;
  opacity:0;
  transform:translateY(20px);
  transition:.5s;
  background:#fff8fa;
  padding:25px;
  border-radius:22px;
  margin:20px auto;
  max-width:700px;
}

.surpriseBox{
  margin:25px auto;
  padding:25px;
  max-width:700px;
  border-radius:25px;
  background:#fff1f5;
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(120,40,70,.15);
  animation:appear .8s ease;
}

.rose{
  font-size:55px;
  animation:roseFloat 2s infinite;
}

footer{
  margin-top:30px;
  font-size:14px;
  color:#8f5368;
}

@keyframes cardIn{
  from{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(35px);
  }
  to{
    opacity:1;
    transform:translateY(0);
  }
}

@keyframes beat{
  0%,100%{transform:scale(1);}
  50%{transform:scale(1.04);}
}

@keyframes pulseBox{
  0%,100%{transform:scale(1);}
  50%{transform:scale(1.15);}
}

@keyframes appear{
  from{
    opacity:0;
    transform:scale(.9);
  }
  to{
    opacity:1;
    transform:scale(1);
  }
}

@keyframes roseFloat{
  0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
  50%{transform:translateY(-8px);}
}

@keyframes floatUp{
  from{
    opacity:1;
    transform:translateY(0) scale(1);
  }
  to{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(-120px) scale(1.6);
  }
}

@media(max-width:600px){

  .section{
    padding:25px 12px;
  }

  .card{
    padding:28px 16px;
  }

  p{
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.7;
  }

  .gallery{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .gallery img{
    height:300px;
  }

  .names{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .envelope{
    transform:scale(.85);
  }

}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<audio id="song" preload="auto">
  <source src="our-song.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
</audio>


<!-- HOME -->

<section id="home" class="section active">

<div class="card">

<h1>Ramsii ❤️</h1>

<div class="date">
16 September 2024 — Our Special Day
</div>

<p>
Some dates are just dates...
but some dates become a beautiful part of our heart.
</p>

<p>
For me, <b>16 September</b> will always be special
because it reminds me of the beginning of our beautiful journey. ❤️
</p>

<div class="musicBox">

<div class="musicIcon">🎵</div>

<h3>Our Little Song</h3>

<p id="musicText">
Tap the button and let our song play ❤️
</p>

<button onclick="playSong()">
▶️ Play Our Song
</button>

</div>

<button onclick="go('letter')">
💌 Open My Letter
</button>

</div>

</section>


<!-- LETTER -->

<section id="letter" class="section">

<div class="card">

<h2>My Apology To You ❤️</h2>

<p>
Ramsii, I know that sometimes my anger becomes bigger
than my patience.
</p>

<p>
I know there were moments when you were already sad
and instead of comforting you,
I became angry and made things even harder for you.
</p>

<p>
I am truly sorry for making you cry,
for making you feel alone,
and for not being the person you needed
in those moments.
</p>

<p>
<b>Praneshwari...</b><br>
<b>Pran Vallabha...</b>
</p>

<p>
I don't want our beautiful memories to be filled
with arguments and ego.
I want more moments where we laugh,
talk peacefully,
pamper each other,
and simply enjoy being together.
</p>

<p>
I cannot change what already happened,
but I can choose how I treat you from now on.
</p>

<p>
And today,
I just want to say one simple thing...
</p>

<h2>I'm Sorry, Ramsii ❤️</h2>

<button onclick="go('gujarati')">
❤️ Ek Dil Ni Vaat
</button>

</div>

</section>


<!-- GUJARATI -->

<section id="gujarati" class="section">

<div class="card">

<h2>Ramsii... Ek Vaat ❤️</h2>

<p>
Jindagi chaar divas ni hoy chhe...
</p>

<p>
Ema thi tran divas toh aapde ek bija sathe ladta,
naraj thata,
ane ek bija thi dur thai ne pasar kari daiye chhiye...
</p>

<p>
Toh pachi shu jarur chhe aatlu badhu ladva ni?
</p>

<p>
Mane bas etlu j joie chhe ke
aapde ek bija sathe thodu vadhu smile kariye,
thodu vadhu pamper kariye,
shanti thi vaat kariye
ane ek bija ne sukoon aapiye. ❤️
</p>

<p>
Hu pan perfect nathi...
pan hu better banva mangu chhu.
</p>

<p>
Tara mate,
aapda mate,
ane aapdi aa beautiful journey mate. ❤️
</p>

<button onclick="gujaratiSurprise()">
❤️ Haan, aaje thi sukoon
</button>

<div id="gujaratiSurprise"></div>

<button onclick="go('envelope')">
💌 Ek Secret Letter
</button>

</div>

</section>


<!-- ENVELOPE -->

<section id="envelope" class="section">

<div class="card">

<h2>For My Ramsii 💌</h2>

<p>
There is something inside this envelope
that I want you to read slowly...
</p>

<div class="envelope" id="envelopeBox" onclick="openEnvelope()">

<div class="envelopeBody"></div>

<div class="envelopeFlap"></div>

<div class="envelopeText">
Tap To Open ❤️
</div>

</div>

<div id="secretLetter" class="secretLetter">

<h3>My Little Secret ❤️</h3>

<p>
If I could go back to every moment
where I made you sad,
I would choose to hold your hand
instead of arguing.
</p>

<p>
If I could go back to every moment
where you needed comfort,
I would choose to stay beside you
instead of letting my anger speak.
</p>

<p>
Because at the end of the day,
winning an argument means nothing
if the person you love is hurting.
</p>

<p>
I want your heart to feel safe with me,
not tired because of me.
</p>

<p>
That's the kind of love
I want to build with you. ❤️
</p>

</div>

<button onclick="go('memories')">
📸 Our Memories
</button>

</div>

</section>


<!-- MEMORIES -->

<section id="memories" class="section">

<div class="card">

<h2>Our Little Memories 📸</h2>

<div class="memory">

<h3>🌙 16 September 2024</h3>

<p>
That late-night Instagram beginning...
a simple conversation
that slowly became something special.
</p>

</div>

<div class="memory">

<h3>🛕 December 2024 — Dwarka</h3>

<p>
A beautiful memory connected with Dwarka,
a place that will always remind me
of moments that became precious to us.
</p>

</div>

<div class="memory">

<h3>🎂 Our Cake Celebration</h3>

<p>
That little celebration,
that cake,
those smiles...
sometimes the smallest moments
become our biggest memories.
</p>

</div>

<div class="memory">

<h3>😂 The Little Things</h3>

<p>
Random conversations,
silly jokes,
fights,
making up,
laughing,
and those late-night talks...
</p>

<p>
These little things are what make
our story ours. ❤️
</p>

</div>

<button onclick="go('gallery')">
🖼️ See Our Pictures
</button>

</div>

</section>


<!-- GALLERY -->

<section id="gallery" class="section">

<div class="card">

<h2>Our Pictures ❤️</h2>

<p>
A few pictures,
a thousand memories.
</p>

<div class="gallery">

<img src="photo1.jpg" alt="Our memory">

<img src="photo2.jpg" alt="Our memory">

<img src="dwarka.jpg" alt="Dwarka memory">

<img src="cake.jpg" alt="Cake celebration">

</div>

<button onclick="go('names')">
❤️ What You Mean To Me
</button>

</div>

</section>


<!-- NAMES -->

<section id="names" class="section">

<div class="card">

<h2>Your Many Names ❤️</h2>

<p>
Some people have one name...
but the person who becomes special
gets many names from the heart.
</p>

<div class="names">

<div class="nameBox">

<h3>Ramsii ❤️</h3>

<p>
The name that instantly brings
a smile to my face.
</p>

</div>

<div class="nameBox">

<h3>Praneshwari 🌹</h3>

<p>
A name that feels precious,
soft and close to my heart.
</p>

</div>

<div class="nameBox">

<h3>Pran Vallabha ❤️</h3>

<p>
The one who holds
a very special place in my heart.
</p>

</div>

<div class="nameBox">

<h3>Priyadarshini ✨</h3>

<p>
