</p>

</div>

</div>

<button onclick="go('promise')">
🤝 My Promise
</button>

</div>

</section>


<!-- PROMISE -->

<section id="promise" class="section">

<div class="card">

<h2>My Promise To You 🤝❤️</h2>

<p>
I am not promising you perfection.
</p>

<p>
I am promising that I will keep trying
to become a better version of myself.
</p>

<p>
When you are hurt,
I will try to understand you
instead of immediately defending myself.
</p>

<p>
When there is an argument,
I will remember that your feelings
are more important than my ego.
</p>

<p>
I will try to show my love through actions,
not only through beautiful words.
</p>

<p>
And whenever life feels heavy,
I want to be someone
who makes your heart a little lighter.
</p>

<p>
Most importantly...
</p>

<p>
<b>
I want to be one of the reasons
behind your smile. ❤️
</b>
</p>

<button onclick="finalSurprise()">
🌹 One Last Surprise
</button>

<div id="finalSurprise"></div>

<button onclick="go('final')">
❤️ Finish Our Story
</button>

</div>

</section>


<!-- FINAL -->

<section id="final" class="section">

<div class="card">

<div class="rose">🌹</div>

<h1>Happy Anniversary</h1>

<h2>Ramsii ❤️</h2>

<div class="date">
16 September 2024
</div>

<p>
No arguments.
</p>

<p>
No ego.
</p>

<p>
No pressure.
</p>

<p>
Just one honest heart saying...
</p>

<h2>
I'm Sorry ❤️
</h2>

<p>
And I still want to make you laugh,
make you smile,
pamper you,
and create many more beautiful memories with you.
</p>

<p>
You are not just a name in my phone.
</p>

<p>
You are <b>Ramsii</b>,
my <b>Praneshwari</b>,
my <b>Pran Vallabha</b>,
my <b>Priyadarshini</b>...
</p>

<p>
and someone who holds
a very special place in my heart. ❤️
</p>

<p>
Thank you for being a part
of my story.
</p>

<p>
Happy Anniversary, Ramsii. ❤️
</p>

<h2>
Tumhara Deepu ❤️
</h2>

<footer>
Made with love for Ramsii ❤️
</footer>

</div>

</section>


<script>


function go(id){

  document.querySelectorAll(".section").forEach(function(sec){

    sec.classList.remove("active");

  });

  document.getElementById(id).classList.add("active");

  window.scrollTo({
    top:0,
    behavior:"smooth"
  });

}


function playSong(){

  const song=document.getElementById("song");

  const text=document.getElementById("musicText");

  song.volume=1.0;

  song.play().then(function(){

    text.innerHTML=
    "🎵 Our song is playing… ❤️";

  }).catch(function(error){

    text.innerHTML=
    "Song nahi mila. Please check that <b>our-song.mp3</b> is in the same folder as index.html.";

    console.log("Audio error:",error);

  });

}


function openEnvelope(){

  const envelope=
  document.getElementById("envelopeBox");

  envelope.classList.toggle("opened");

  const secret=
  document.getElementById("secretLetter");

  if(envelope.classList.contains("opened")){

    secret.style.display="block";

    setTimeout(function(){

      secret.style.opacity="1";

      secret.style.transform="translateY(0)";

    },100);

  }
  else{

    secret.style.opacity="0";

    secret.style.transform="translateY(20px)";

    setTimeout(function(){

      secret.style.display="none";

    },500);

  }

}


function gujaratiSurprise(){

  const box=
  document.getElementById("gujaratiSurprise");

  box.style.display="block";

  box.innerHTML=`

    <div class="surpriseBox">

      <h2>❤️ Ramsii...</h2>

      <p>
      Aa bas ek button nathi...
      aa mari dil ni ek nani si vaat chhe.
      </p>

      <p>
      Hu nathi ichhto ke aapde koi pan fight pachi
      ek bija thi naraj thai ne sui jaiye.
      </p>

      <p>
      Koi ek toh thodu ego side ma muki ne
      bija pase aavi ne kahi de...
      <b>"Chal, badhu bhuli jaie ❤️"</b>
      </p>

      <p>
      Life khub nani chhe Ramsii...
      ane je vyakti ne aapde khush jovu hoy
      eni sathe ladva ma aapdu time waste na thavu joie.
      </p>

      <p>
      Aaje thi thodu vadhu sukoon,
      thodu vadhu pampering,
      thodu vadhu understanding
      ane ghanu badhu love. 🫰❤️
      </p>

    </div>

  `;

  heartBurst();

}


function finalSurprise(){

  const box=
  document.getElementById("finalSurprise");

  box.style.display="block";

  box.innerHTML=`

    <div class="surpriseBox">

      <div class="rose">🌹</div>

      <h2>Ramsii ❤️</h2>

      <p>
      Hu perfect banvanu promise nathi karto...
      pan hu better banvanu promise karu chhu.
      </p>

      <p>
      Jyare tu hurt hoy tyare tane samajhvani
      koshish karish.
      </p>

      <p>
      Jyare ego ane feelings vachche choice karvani aavshe,
      tyare tari feelings ne importance aapish.
      </p>

      <p>
      Fakat words thi nahi...
      mara actions thi tane feel karavish
      ke tu mara mate ketli important chhe.
      </p>

      <p>
      Ane sauthi important...
      hu tari smile nu ek reason banva mangu chhu. ❤️
      </p>

      <p>
      Aa varse shayad badhu perfect rite
      cake ke celebration sathe na thayu hoy...
      pan hu ichchhu chhu ke jyare tu aa page yaad kare,
      tyare tara face par ek smile aave
      ane tu kahe...
      </p>

      <p>
      <b>
      "He really tried to make me smile." ❤️
      </b>
      </p>

    </div>

  `;

  heartBurst();

}


function createHeart(){

  const heart=
  document.createElement("div");

  heart.innerHTML="❤️";

  heart.style.position="fixed";

  heart.style.left=
  (Math.random()*100)+"vw";

  heart.style.bottom="-30px";

  heart.style.fontSize=
  (15+Math.random()*25)+"px";

  heart.style.zIndex="999";

  heart.style.pointerEvents="none";

  heart.style.animation=
  "floatUp "+(4+Math.random()*4)+"s ease-out forwards";

  document.body.appendChild(heart);

  setTimeout(function(){

    heart.remove();

  },8000);

}


setInterval(createHeart,500);


function heartBurst(){

  for(let i=0;i<25;i++){

    const heart=
    document.createElement("div");

    heart.innerHTML="❤️";

    heart.style.position="fixed";

    heart.style.left=
    (30+Math.random()*40)+"vw";

    heart.style.top=
    (40+Math.random()*20)+"vh";

    heart.style.fontSize=
    (15+Math.random()*25)+"px";

    heart.style.zIndex="999";

    heart.style.pointerEvents="none";

    heart.style.animation=
    "floatUp 3s ease-out forwards";

    document.body.appendChild(heart);

    setTimeout(function(){

      heart.remove();

    },3000);

  }

}


</script>

</body>
</html>
